## Modifications

The following modifications have been applied to the upstream codebase:

1. **Branding**: All references to "Gentleman.Dots", "gentleman-dots", "GENTLEMAN_*", and related branding have been changed to "dotfiles", "DOTFILES_*", etc. See [DOWNSTREAM.md](DOWNSTREAM.md) for full details.
2. **Binary name**: The installer binary is named `dotfiles` (not `gentleman-dots` or `gentleman.dots`).
3. **Package directories**: All `Gentleman*` directories renamed to `dotfiles-*`.
4. **Clone URL**: Defaults to `https://github.com/albersg/dotfiles.git`.
5. **Homebrew tap**: Changed from `Gentleman-Programming/tap` to `albersg/tap`.
6. **Documentation**: README, AGENTS.md updated for downstream identity; new docs added in `docs/`.

